  "releaseNotes": "0.7.8: 16-bit JPEG XL reading and writing with PictureSharp 0.9.0. PreserveBitDepth retains deeper color and alpha; lossless encoding preserves every 16-bit sample. Existing 8-bit output and JPEG transcoding are unchanged. Requires PictureSharp 0.9.0.",
